X03A01 ~y~Sergeant:~w~ Check the sandbags. Count our men. Stay sharp, some may still be out there.
X03A02 ~r~Militant:~w~ I am hit! Cover me, I am falling back!
X03A03 ~r~A wounded militant is slipping away down the gorge. Finish him!
X03A04 ~y~Sergeant:~w~ Reload, quick! Pull back behind the sandbags. They will come again.
